          "short": "$\\frac{x}{6}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x+2}{2}-\\frac{x+3}{3}&=\\frac{3(x+2)-2(x+3)}{6}\\\\\\frac{x+2}{2}-\\frac{x+3}{3}&=\\frac{3x+6-2x-6}{6}\\\\\\frac{x+2}{2}-\\frac{x+3}{3}&=\\frac{x}{6}\\end{align*}$$",
